-# Every path below stays analyzed by Sonar and keeps its own tests; only the
-# coverage percentage ignores it, because the portable Linux scanner cannot
-# execute it. Five groups, each named file by file and justified in docs/ci.md
-# with the receipt that does prove its behaviour. Do not turn unavailable host
-# paths into fake coverage, and do not extend this list to code a test can reach.
-#
-# 1. Maintainer-only qualification programs: a real Darwin release host,
-#    Docker/Codex or both for their executable main paths.
-# 2. M2 probes whose only executable path creates containers against the
-#    approved image on a local Docker daemon.
-# 3. Closed Docker gateway phase construction and execution, plus the ports that
-#    only reach the application through a live `RustGateway`.
-# 4. Durable quality publication bound to the macOS ARM64 store, which has no
-#    constructor off that host. The store adapters themselves stay measured:
-#    their portable digests and their unsupported-platform refusals are tested.
-# 5. Host entrypoints: the stdio server assembly, the binary's argv dispatch and
-#    the real-client inspector session.
-sonar.coverage.exclusions=scripts/codex-model-qualifier.py,scripts/release-artifact.py,scripts/release-smoke.py,scripts/verify-vendor.py,scripts/probe-m2-cargo-fix.py,scripts/probe-m2-fix-socket-mask.py,scripts/probe-m2-guest-staging.py,scripts/probe-m2-offline-registry.py,scripts/probe-m2-vendor-data.py,scripts/probe-m2-write-primitives.py,scripts/m3-inspector-session.mjs,crates/execution-adapter/src/lib.rs,crates/execution-adapter/src/rust_gateway.rs,crates/execution-adapter/src/mutation_gateway.rs,crates/execution-adapter/src/mutation_test_gateway.rs,crates/execution-adapter/src/nextest_gateway.rs,crates/execution-adapter/src/coverage_gateway.rs,crates/execution-adapter/src/semver_gateway.rs,crates/execution-adapter/src/resolution_gateway.rs,crates/execution-adapter/src/project_inspection.rs,crates/execution-adapter/src/coverage_port.rs,crates/execution-adapter/src/nextest_port.rs,crates/execution-adapter/src/mutation_test_port.rs,crates/execution-adapter/src/semver_port.rs,crates/mcp-server/src/stdio/quality_artifacts.rs,crates/mcp-server/src/stdio.rs,crates/mcp-server/src/main.rs
